# -- title: Quest_For_Chalice_Compacted (CHIP-8 1977 Port)
# -- author: Daniel Hanrahan Tools and Games
# -- license: GPL-3.0
# -- version: 3.8 (Mid-Air Steering Restored & Mixed 1-2 Barrels)
# -- input: keyboard (A = Left, D = Right, S = Jump / Start)

